{"id":"2c01cc575d2f007e1549b4cf5e9aceaac57301b0","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"2c01cc575d2f007e1549b4cf5e9aceaac57301b0","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/bounded-workspace-installs.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+\"pacquet\": patch","+---","+","+`pnpm install` is faster and uses less memory in large workspaces with `sharedWorkspaceLockfile: false`. Each project's install no longer reads the manifests of every other workspace project again. Installs that wait for their workspace dependencies now count toward `workspaceConcurrency` [#16966](https://github.com/pnpm/pnpm/issues/16966)."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/pipelines.rs","lines":["@@ -144,6 +144,8 @@ pub(crate) struct DedicatedProjects {","     /// The projects a pipelined run may start ahead of the workspace","     /// projects they depend on. See [`pipelined_runs::early_starts`].","     early_starts: HashSet<PathBuf>,","+    /// Every workspace project, as the command discovered them.","+    workspace: pnpm_package_manager::DiscoveredWorkspace,"," }"," "," impl DedicatedProjects {","@@ -172,6 +174,7 @@ impl DedicatedProjects {","             covers_workspace,","             injected_source_dirs,","             early_starts,","+            workspace: pnpm_package_manager::DiscoveredWorkspace::new(selection.projects),","         }","     }"," ","@@ -227,7 +230,9 @@ struct DedicatedProjectRuns<'a> {","     /// Whether the projects run pipelined: each resolves and materializes","     /// without waiting for the workspace projects it depends on, and waits","     /// for them only before it links its dependencies and runs its scripts.","-    /// Only an install, which changes no manifest, runs pipelined.","+    /// Only an install, which changes no manifest, runs pipelined, so its","+    /// projects also read [`DedicatedProjects::workspace`] instead","+    /// of walking the workspace each.","     pipelined: bool,"," }"," "],"additions":6,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/pipelines/dedicated_runs.rs","lines":["@@ -95,7 +95,11 @@ impl DedicatedProjectRuns<'_> {","             self.require_lockfile,","             self.http_client.as_ref().map(Arc::clone),","         )?","-        .into_dedicated_project(caches, dependencies_installed);","+        .into_dedicated_project(","+            caches,","+            dependencies_installed,","+            self.pipelined.then(|| self.projects.workspace.clone()),","+        );","         // A project's install blocks its thread in places, such as while its","         // lifecycle scripts run. On its own task, the other projects'","         // installs move to another worker then."],"additions":5,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/pipelines/install.rs","lines":["@@ -281,6 +281,7 @@ pub(super) async fn run_dedicated_lockfile_workspace_install<Reporter: self::Rep","             covers_workspace: true,","             injected_source_dirs,","             early_starts: early_starts(cfg, &projects),","+            workspace: pnpm_package_manager::DiscoveredWorkspace::new(projects),","         },","         require_lockfile,","         http_client: Some(http_client),"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/pipelines/pipelined_runs.rs","lines":["@@ -2,8 +2,12 @@"," //! own lockfiles ahead of the workspace projects they depend on."," //!"," //! Resolving, fetching and materializing a project reads nothing the installs","-//! of its workspace dependencies produce, so each project starts as soon as a","-//! concurrency slot is free, in dependency order. It waits for those installs","+//! of its workspace dependencies produce, so a project starts once each of","+//! them has started, with at most `workspaceConcurrency` installs in flight.","+//! An install counts from its start until it returns, waits included, because","+//! it retains materialized state. Every install in flight then depends only on","+//! installs that are in flight or done, so the earliest of them can finish.","+//! A project waits for its workspace dependencies' installs"," //! only where they start to matter: before it links its dependencies and runs"," //! its lifecycle scripts. The scripts of a project therefore still run after"," //! the scripts of every workspace project it depends on, as they do when each","@@ -27,20 +31,18 @@ use std::{","         atomic::{AtomicBool, Ordering},","     },"," };","-use tokio::sync::{OwnedSemaphorePermit, Semaphore, watch};","+use tokio::sync::{Semaphore, watch};"," "," /// How far a project's install got, for the projects that depend on it."," #[derive(Clone, Copy, PartialEq, Eq)]"," enum Installed {","     Pending,","+    /// Holds one of the in-flight slots.","+    Started,","     Succeeded,","     Failed,"," }"," ","-/// The concurrency slot a project's install holds, which it hands back while","-/// it waits for its workspace dependencies.","-type Slot = Arc<Mutex<Option<OwnedSemaphorePermit>>>;","-"," /// The projects whose install may run ahead of the workspace projects they"," /// depend on. A project whose `preinstall` or `pnpm:devPreinstall` script"," /// runs before its install reaches the wait, or that copies a workspace","@@ -97,15 +99,16 @@ impl DedicatedProjectRuns<'_> {","         RunFuture: Future<Output = miette::Result<()>> + Send + 'static,","     {","         let order = sequence_project_dependencies(&self.projects.dependencies);","+        let concurrency = usize::try_from(self.config.workspace_concurrency)","+            .unwrap_or(usize::MAX)","+            .clamp(1, Semaphore::MAX_PERMITS);","         let run = PipelinedRun {","             runs: self,","             states: order","                 .iter()","                 .map(|_| watch::channel(Installed::Pending).0)","                 .collect(),","-            slots: Arc::new(Semaphore::new(","-                usize::try_from(self.config.workspace_concurrency).unwrap_or(usize::MAX).max(1),","-            )),","+            slots: Semaphore::new(concurrency),","             stopped: Arc::new(AtomicBool::new(false)),","             first_error: Mutex::new(None),","             caches: DedicatedCaches::default(),","@@ -134,7 +137,7 @@ struct PipelinedRun<'r, 'c, Runner> {","     runs: &'r DedicatedProjectRuns<'c>,","     /// Indexed like the dependency order the projects start in.","     states: Vec<watch::Sender<Installed>>,","-    slots: Arc<Semaphore>,","+    slots: Semaphore,","     /// Set by the first failure when the command stops at it, so that no","     /// project that has yet to start, or to link, does.","     stopped: Arc<AtomicBool>,","@@ -151,27 +154,21 @@ where","     async fn project(&self, index: usize, project_dir: &Path, position: &HashMap<&Path, usize>) {","         let dependencies_installed = self.dependencies_installed(index, project_dir, position);","         let starts_early = self.runs.projects.early_starts.contains(project_dir);","-        if !starts_early && !dependencies_installed.clone().await {","+        if starts_early {","+            self.dependencies_started(index, project_dir, position).await;","+        } else if !dependencies_installed.clone().await {","             self.states[index].send_replace(Installed::Failed);","             return;","         }","-        let slot: Slot = Arc::new(Mutex::new(Some(","-            Arc::clone(&self.slots)","-                .acquire_owned()","-                .await","-                .expect(\"the concurrency slots are never closed\"),","-        )));","+        let slot = self.slots.acquire().await.expect(\"the install slots are never closed\");","         if self.stopped.load(Ordering::Acquire) {","             self.states[index].send_replace(Installed::Failed);","             return;","         }","-        let gate = starts_early.then(|| self.gate(dependencies_installed.clone(), &slot));","+        self.states[index].send_replace(Installed::Started);","+        let gate = starts_early.then(|| self.gate(dependencies_installed.clone()));","         let result = self.runs.install_project(project_dir, &self.caches, gate, self.run).await;","-        drop(","-            slot.lock()","-                .expect(\"slot lock is not poisoned\")","-                .take(),","-        );","+        drop(slot);","         let failed = result.is_err();","         record_dedicated_result(&self.first_error, result);","         if failed && self.runs.config.bail {","@@ -198,19 +195,15 @@ where","         project_dir: &Path,","         position: &HashMap<&Path, usize>,","     ) -> WorkspaceDependenciesInstalled {","-        let dependencies: Vec<watch::Receiver<Installed>> = self.runs.projects.dependencies","-            [project_dir]","-            .iter()","-            .filter_map(|dependency| position.get(dependency.as_path()).copied())","-            .filter(|&dependency| dependency < index)","-            .map(|dependency| self.states[dependency].subscribe())","-            .collect();","+        let dependencies = self.dependency_states(index, project_dir, position);","         let bail = self.runs.config.bail;","         let settled: BoxFuture<'static, bool> = async move {","             let mut all_succeeded = true;","             for mut dependency in dependencies {","                 let installed = dependency","-                    .wait_for(|installed| *installed != Installed::Pending)","+                    .wait_for(|installed| {","+                        matches!(installed, Installed::Succeeded | Installed::Failed)","+                    })","                     .await","                     .map_or(Installed::Failed, |installed| *installed);","                 all_succeeded &= installed == Installed::Succeeded;","@@ -221,32 +214,45 @@ where","         settled.shared()","     }"," ","-    /// `dependencies_installed` as the install awaits it: the install hands","-    /// its concurrency slot back while it waits, so that a project waiting","-    /// on its dependencies never keeps one of them, or any other project,","-    /// from running. `false` too when the command stopped at another","-    /// project's failure in the meantime, so the install links nothing.","+    /// Resolves once every workspace project `project_dir` depends on, as","+    /// [`Self::dependencies_installed`] counts them, has started or settled.","+    async fn dependencies_started(","+        &self,","+        index: usize,","+        project_dir: &Path,","+        position: &HashMap<&Path, usize>,","+    ) {","+        for mut dependency in self.dependency_states(index, project_dir, position) {","+            // A closed channel means the dependency's install is gone, which","+            // is as good as settled for starting.","+            let _ = dependency.wait_for(|installed| *installed != Installed::Pending).await;","+        }","+    }","+","+    fn dependency_states(","+        &self,","+        index: usize,","+        project_dir: &Path,","+        position: &HashMap<&Path, usize>,","+    ) -> Vec<watch::Receiver<Installed>> {","+        self.runs.projects.dependencies[project_dir]","+            .iter()","+            .filter_map(|dependency| position.get(dependency.as_path()).copied())","+            .filter(|&dependency| dependency < index)","+            .map(|dependency| self.states[dependency].subscribe())","+            .collect()","+    }","+","+    /// `dependencies_installed` as the install awaits it: `false` too when","+    /// the command stopped at another project's failure in the meantime, so","+    /// the install links nothing.","     fn gate(","         &self,","         dependencies_installed: WorkspaceDependenciesInstalled,","-        slot: &Slot,","     ) -> WorkspaceDependenciesInstalled {","-        let slot = Arc::clone(slot);","-        let slots = Arc::clone(&self.slots);","         let stopped = Arc::clone(&self.stopped);","-        let gate: BoxFuture<'static, bool> = async move {","-            drop(","-                slot.lock()","-                    .expect(\"slot lock is not poisoned\")","-                    .take(),","-            );","-            let succeeded = dependencies_installed.await;","-            let permit =","-                slots.acquire_owned().await.expect(\"the concurrency slots are never closed\");","-            *slot.lock().expect(\"slot lock is not poisoned\") = Some(permit);","-            succeeded && !stopped.load(Ordering::Acquire)","-        }","-        .boxed();","+        let gate: BoxFuture<'static, bool> =","+            async move { dependencies_installed.await && !stopped.load(Ordering::Acquire) }.boxed();","         gate.shared()","     }"," }"],"additions":59,"deletions":53,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/state.rs","lines":["@@ -115,19 +115,22 @@ impl State {"," ","     /// Make this state's install one project's among the several a command","     /// runs: it shares `caches`, the tarball cache included, with the","-    /// others, and waits for `dependencies_installed` where its project's","-    /// installed dependencies start to matter.","+    /// others, waits for `dependencies_installed` where its project's","+    /// installed dependencies start to matter, and reads `workspace`, when","+    /// given, instead of walking the workspace.","     #[must_use]","     pub(crate) fn into_dedicated_project(","         self,","         caches: &DedicatedCaches,","         dependencies_installed: Option<WorkspaceDependenciesInstalled>,","+        workspace: Option<pnpm_package_manager::DiscoveredWorkspace>,","     ) -> Self {","         State {","             tarball_mem_cache: Arc::clone(&caches.tarballs),","             dedicated: Some(DedicatedProjectInstall {","                 caches: caches.install.clone(),","                 dependencies_installed,","+                workspace,","             }),","             ..self","         }"],"additions":5,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/workspace_install.rs","lines":["@@ -1552,6 +1552,7 @@ fn shared_workspace_lockfile_false_installs_independent_projects_concurrently()"," mod dedicated_global_virtual_store;"," mod freshness;"," mod pipelined;","+mod workspace_discovery;"," "," #[cfg(unix)]"," #[test]"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/workspace_install/pipelined.rs","lines":["@@ -93,6 +93,101 @@ module.exports = { hooks: { readPackage(pkg) {","     assert_eq!(order, \"lib;app;\");"," }"," ","+/// An install waiting for a workspace dependency still counts toward the","+/// concurrency limit, since it retains its resolved and materialized state.","+#[test]","+fn waiting_projects_count_toward_workspace_concurrency() {","+    let fixture = CommandTempCwd::init().add_mocked_registry();","+    let workspace = &fixture.workspace;","+    workspace_projects(","+        workspace,","+        &[","+            (","+                \"lib\",","+                serde_json::json!({}),","+                serde_json::json!({","+                    \"postinstall\": r#\"node -e \"const fs = require('fs'); const deadline = Date.now() + 30000; const poll = () => { if (fs.existsSync('../../app-resolving')) return setTimeout(() => fs.writeFileSync('../../lib-built', ''), 1000); if (Date.now() > deadline) process.exit(1); setTimeout(poll, 20); }; poll()\"\"#,","+                }),","+            ),","+            (\"app\", serde_json::json!({ \"lib\": \"workspace:*\" }), serde_json::json!({})),","+            (\"tail\", serde_json::json!({ \"app\": \"workspace:*\" }), serde_json::json!({})),","+        ],","+    );","+    fs::write(","+        workspace.join(\"packages/app/.pnpmfile.cjs\"),","+        r\"const fs = require('fs');","+const path = require('path');","+module.exports = { hooks: { readPackage(pkg) {","+  fs.writeFileSync(path.join(__dirname, '../../app-resolving'), '');","+  return pkg;","+} } };","+\",","+    )","+    .expect(\"write app pnpmfile\");","+    fs::write(","+        workspace.join(\"packages/tail/.pnpmfile.cjs\"),","+        r\"const fs = require('fs');","+const path = require('path');","+module.exports = { hooks: { readPackage(pkg) {","+  if (!fs.existsSync(path.join(__dirname, '../../lib-built'))) {","+    throw new Error('third project started while two installs were unfinished');","+  }","+  return pkg;","+} } };","+\",","+    )","+    .expect(\"write tail pnpmfile\");","+","+    pacquet_at(workspace)","+        .with_args([\"install\", \"--workspace-concurrency=2\", \"--no-lockfile\"])","+        .assert()","+        .success();","+","+    assert!(workspace.join(\"lib-built\").exists());","+    assert!(workspace.join(\"packages/tail/node_modules/app\").exists());","+}","+","+/// A project that cannot start before its workspace dependencies finish","+/// holds no slot while it waits, so a later project that is ready runs. Here","+/// `w-waits` (a `preinstall`) waits for `a-slow`, and `a-slow`'s","+/// `postinstall` waits for `y-ready`'s, with two slots.","+#[test]","+fn a_project_waiting_to_start_leaves_its_slot_to_ready_projects() {","+    let fixture = CommandTempCwd::init().add_mocked_registry();","+    let workspace = &fixture.workspace;","+    workspace_projects(","+        workspace,","+        &[","+            (","+                \"a-slow\",","+                serde_json::json!({}),","+                serde_json::json!({ \"postinstall\": wait_for_then_record(\"y-ready-done\", \"a-slow\") }),","+            ),","+            (\"c-fast\", serde_json::json!({}), serde_json::json!({})),","+            (","+                \"w-waits\",","+                serde_json::json!({ \"a-slow\": \"workspace:*\" }),","+                serde_json::json!({ \"preinstall\": r#\"node -e \"\"\"# }),","+            ),","+            (","+                \"y-ready\",","+                serde_json::json!({ \"c-fast\": \"workspace:*\" }),","+                serde_json::json!({","+                    \"postinstall\": r#\"node -e \"require('fs').writeFileSync('../../y-ready-done', '')\"\"#,","+                }),","+            ),","+        ],","+    );","+","+    pacquet_at(workspace)","+        .with_args([\"install\", \"--workspace-concurrency=2\", \"--no-lockfile\"])","+        .assert()","+        .success();","+","+    let order = fs::read_to_string(workspace.join(\"order.txt\")).expect(\"read order.txt\");","+    assert_eq!(order, \"a-slow;\");","+}","+"," /// A project's `preinstall` and `pnpm:devPreinstall` scripts run before"," /// its install could wait for the workspace projects it depends on, so such"," /// a project waits for them before it starts at all."],"additions":95,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/workspace_install/workspace_discovery.rs","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,108 @@","+use super::{CommandExtra, CommandTempCwd, Path, assert_eq, fs, pacquet_at};","+use assert_cmd::assert::OutputAssertExt;","+","+fn workspace(workspace: &Path) {","+    fs::write(","+        workspace.join(\"pnpm-workspace.yaml\"),","+        \"packages:\\n  - 'packages/*'\\nsharedWorkspaceLockfile: false\\nworkspaceConcurrency: 1\\n\",","+    )","+    .unwrap();","+    fs::write(workspace.join(\"package.json\"), r#\"{\"name\":\"root\",\"private\":true}\"#).unwrap();","+    for (name, dependencies) in","+        [(\"lib\", serde_json::json!({})), (\"app\", serde_json::json!({ \"lib\": \"workspace:*\" }))]","+    {","+        let dir = workspace.join(\"packages\").join(name);","+        fs::create_dir_all(&dir).unwrap();","+        fs::write(","+            dir.join(\"package.json\"),","+            serde_json::json!({","+                \"name\": name, \"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"dependencies\": dependencies,","+            })","+            .to_string(),","+        )","+        .unwrap();","+    }","+    let dist = workspace.join(\"packages/lib/dist\");","+    fs::create_dir_all(&dist).unwrap();","+    fs::write(dist.join(\"package.json\"), r#\"{\"name\":\"lib\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\"}\"#).unwrap();","+}","+","+fn assert_lib_target(workspace: &Path, directory: &str) {","+    assert_eq!(","+        fs::canonicalize(workspace.join(\"packages/app/node_modules/lib\")).unwrap(),","+        fs::canonicalize(workspace.join(\"packages/lib\").join(directory)).unwrap(),","+    );","+    let lockfile = super::read_lockfile(&workspace.join(\"packages/app/pnpm-lock.yaml\"));","+    assert_eq!(lockfile.importers.len(), 1);","+    assert!(lockfile.importers.contains_key(\".\"));","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn filtered_dedicated_install_resolves_unselected_siblings_and_reloads_next_command() {","+    let fixture = CommandTempCwd::init().add_mocked_registry();","+    workspace(&fixture.workspace);","+    pacquet_at(&fixture.workspace)","+        .with_args([\"install\", \"--filter\", \"app\", \"--ignore-scripts\"])","+        .assert()","+        .success();","+    assert_lib_target(&fixture.workspace, \"\");","+    assert!(!fixture.workspace.join(\"packages/lib/pnpm-lock.yaml\").exists());","+","+    let manifest_path = fixture.workspace.join(\"packages/lib/package.json\");","+    let mut manifest: serde_json::Value =","+        serde_json::from_str(&fs::read_to_string(&manifest_path).unwrap()).unwrap();","+    manifest[\"publishConfig\"] = serde_json::json!({ \"directory\": \"dist\" });","+    fs::write(manifest_path, manifest.to_string()).unwrap();","+    // Resolve again without the previous lockfile's workspace link target.","+    fs::remove_file(fixture.workspace.join(\"packages/app/pnpm-lock.yaml\")).unwrap();","+    fs::remove_dir_all(fixture.workspace.join(\"packages/app/node_modules\")).unwrap();","+    pacquet_at(&fixture.workspace)","+        .with_args([\"install\", \"--filter\", \"app\", \"--ignore-scripts\", \"--force\"])","+        .assert()","+        .success();","+    assert_lib_target(&fixture.workspace, \"dist\");","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn dedicated_install_without_scripts_injects_workspace_dependencies() {","+    let fixture = CommandTempCwd::init().add_mocked_registry();","+    workspace(&fixture.workspace);","+    fs::write(","+        fixture.workspace.join(\"packages/app/package.json\"),","+        serde_json::json!({","+            \"name\": \"app\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\",","+            \"dependencies\": { \"lib\": \"workspace:*\" },","+            \"dependenciesMeta\": { \"lib\": { \"injected\": true } },","+        })","+        .to_string(),","+    )","+    .unwrap();","+    fs::write(","+        fixture.workspace.join(\"packages/lib/package.json\"),","+        serde_json::json!({","+            \"name\": \"lib\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"dependencies\": { \"is-positive\": \"1.0.0\" },","+        })","+        .to_string(),","+    )","+    .unwrap();","+    pacquet_at(&fixture.workspace)","+        .with_args([\"install\", \"--ignore-scripts\", \"--config.dedupe-injected-deps=false\"])","+        .assert()","+        .success();","+    let injected = fixture.workspace.join(\"packages/app/node_modules/lib\");","+    assert_ne!(","+        fs::canonicalize(&injected).unwrap(),","+        fs::canonicalize(fixture.workspace.join(\"packages/lib\")).unwrap(),","+    );","+    let manifest: serde_json::Value =","+        serde_json::from_str(&fs::read_to_string(injected.join(\"package.json\")).unwrap()).unwrap();","+    assert_eq!(manifest[\"dependencies\"][\"is-positive\"], \"1.0.0\");","+    let installed = fs::canonicalize(&injected).unwrap();","+    assert!(","+        installed","+            .parent()","+            .unwrap()","+            .join(\"is-positive/package.json\")","+            .exists(),","+    );","+}"],"additions":108,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/package-manager/src/install.rs","lines":["@@ -414,6 +414,37 @@ pub struct DedicatedProjectInstall {","     /// installs of the workspace projects it depends on produce. `None`","     /// waits f